<programme start="20261019115700 +0000" stop="20261019123800 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Terror</title><sub-title lang="en">Infamy: Come and Get Me</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Terminal Islanders return home to find that things have changed since they left; the Nakayamas, still tense from the pain they&apos;ve inflicted on one another, must come together to battle the spirit that threatens their future.</desc><credits><actor>Derek Mio</actor><actor>Shingo Usami</actor><actor>Naoko Mori</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15107294_b_v12_ad.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261019123800 +0000" stop="20261019132600 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Terror</title><sub-title lang="en">Infamy: Into the Afterlife</sub-title><desc lang="en">Henry and Asako look to the past to provide answers to their current turmoil; Chester and Luz grapple with their identities in hopes of saving those who are dearest to them; Amy and Yamato-san struggle to once again assimilate into American life.</desc><credits><actor>Derek Mio</actor><actor>Shingo Usami</actor><actor>Naoko Mori</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15107294_b_v12_ad.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261019132600 +0000" stop="20261019141900 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Terror</title><sub-title lang="en">Infamy: A Sparrow in a Swallow&apos;s Nest</sub-title><desc lang="en">In 1941, Chester Nakayama is caught between his insular Japanese-American neighborhood on Terminal Island and his current all-American life; extreme circumstances push his community and personal life to the brink, all while someone watches closely.</desc><credits><actor>Derek Mio</actor><actor>Shingo Usami</actor><actor>Naoko Mori</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15107294_b_v12_ad.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261019141900 +0000" stop="20261019150300 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Terror</title><sub-title lang="en">Infamy: All the Demons Are Still in Hell</sub-title><desc lang="en">After Pearl Harbor, the Terminal Islanders are evicted from their homes and must find shelter elsewhere; while Henry, separated from his family, faces injustice at the hands of the government, Chester engages in a paranoid search for answers.</desc><credits><actor>Derek Mio</actor><actor>Shingo Usami</actor><actor>Naoko Mori</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15107294_b_v12_ad.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261019150300 +0000" stop="20261019154600 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Terror</title><sub-title lang="en">Infamy: Gaman</sub-title><desc lang="en">As the Terminal Islanders adjust to their new surroundings, Chester tries to provide for his family, while fending off the evil that follows him; Henry reels from the trauma of his imprisonment; Asako sees bad omens; Amy takes up a new job.</desc><credits><actor>Derek Mio</actor><actor>Shingo Usami</actor><actor>Naoko Mori</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15107294_b_v12_ad.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261019154600 +0000" stop="20261019163000 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Terror</title><sub-title lang="en">Infamy: The Weak Are Meat</sub-title><desc lang="en">Chester, in search of a better life, is treated with hostility by his fellow Americans; Luz hopes to be accepted by Henry and Asako in their new home as the Japanese American community celebrates Obon, a festival to commemorate the dead.</desc><credits><actor>Derek Mio</actor><actor>Shingo Usami</actor><actor>Naoko Mori</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15107294_b_v12_ad.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261019163000 +0000" stop="20261019171400 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Terror</title><sub-title lang="en">Infamy: Shatter Like a Pearl</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Japanese Americans are forced to undertake a humiliating exercise that divides the community; Chester comes face to face with a man who forces him to question his very nature; Luz, stricken by grief, is forced to make an important choice.</desc><credits><actor>Derek Mio</actor><actor>Shingo Usami</actor><actor>Naoko Mori</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15107294_b_v12_ad.jpg"/></programme>
