<programme start="20261020180000 +0000" stop="20261020190000 +0000" channel="Sci 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Secrets in the Sand</title><sub-title lang="en">Forgotten Mongol Soldiers and an Ancient Iraqi Tavern</sub-title><desc lang="en">Inspect a Mongolian mass grave and learn the fate of a platoon of soldiers, then investigate a 5,000-year-old tavern in Iraq; examine an Egyptian scarab that&apos;s far from home and ancient tools that show where desert migration routes once lay.</desc><category lang="en">Travel</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25391133_b_v12_aj.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261020190000 +0000" stop="20261020200000 +0000" channel="Sci 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Secrets in the Sand</title><sub-title lang="en">Drowned Stone Age Fisherman</sub-title><desc lang="en">Scan the skeleton of a drowned Stone Age fisherman in Chile and rediscover a vanished golden age in Egypt&apos;s lost city of Aten; ancient Chinese mummies reignite a cultural debate; discover a massive biblical-era moat in Jerusalem.</desc><category lang="en">Travel</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25391133_b_v12_aj.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261020200000 +0000" stop="20261020210000 +0000" channel="Sci 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Secrets in the Sand</title><sub-title lang="en">The Atacama</sub-title><desc lang="en">Examine a tiny skeleton in Chile that set off a firestorm of alien speculation; explore a forgotten Silk Road settlement; uncover evidence of a mass sacrifice in northern Peru and visit a multi-faceted military site from the age of the pharaohs.</desc><category lang="en">Travel</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25391133_b_v12_aj.jpg"/></programme>
