<programme start="20261021150000 +0000" stop="20261021160000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El clon</title><sub-title lang="es">Nuevo departamento</sub-title><desc lang="es">Said no permite que Jade se despida de su hija. Edna invita a Deusa y Léo a cenar en casa. Escobar planea comprar un departamento y ponerlo a nombre de Alicinha. Maysa le pide ayuda a Said para que Xande sea despedido y Mel regrese a casa.</desc><credits><director>Jayme Monjardim</director><actor>Murilo Benício</actor><actor>Giovanna Antonelli</actor><actor>Letícia Sabatella</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Adriana Lessa</actor><actor>Vera Fischer</actor><actor>Reginaldo Faria</actor><actor>Dalton Vigh</actor><actor>Daniela Escobar</actor><actor>Débora Falabella</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Antonio Calloni</actor><actor>Stênio Garcia</actor><actor>Jandira Martini</actor><actor>Neuza Borges</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Nívea Maria</actor><actor>Solange Couto</actor><actor>Osmar Prado</actor><actor>Cissa Guimarães</actor><actor>Marcos Frota</actor><actor>Sthefany Brito</actor></credits><date>20261020</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.130.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E131</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/6be018843df8b712f1b2f0b519c62469.jpeg"/></programme>
